Ba&#351;kanl&#305;&#287;&#305;na<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:11.35pt;margin-bottom:
0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:42.55pt;line-height:normal'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>Görü&#351;ülmekte olan 287
